paths, letting you craft deadly combos on the fly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With 70+ Relics and three upgrade paths each, you've got <i>over a trillion</i> possible builds. No two games will ever be alike.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2654490/extras/da1df0d87961f36c66febd72adb866b7.avif?t=1755819292\" width=785 height=116 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2654490/extras/ced5599334d5eb75db3535d76a050e77.avif?t=1755819292\" width=800 height=718 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Leaders</strong> don\u2019t just tweak the game\u2014they <i>rewrite</i> it. Want to destroy your enemy from the inside out? Try Vlad the Impaler. Want to master the economy? Pick Karl Marx. Or are you just hungry for bananas? Then Harambe is the leader for you! Every Leader has a unique ability that can be leveled up, unlocking game-breaking powers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2654490/extras/ff4300b90102b30bcdc3b8965ace68e3.avif?t=1755819292\" width=800 height=103 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2654490/extras/5c6cbb732c9d7a9755ac479222594dd6.poster.avif?t=1755819292\" width=600 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2654490/extras/5c6cbb732c9d7a9755ac479222594dd6.webm?t=1755819292\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2654490/extras/5c6cbb732c9d7a9755ac479222594dd6.mp4?t=1755819292\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buying the same <strong>Relic </strong>again powers it up\u2014unlocking branching <strong>Super Upgrades</strong>. Max it out, and you\u2019ll get a <strong>Juicy Upgrade</strong>: a devastating power spike that is so strong, it can end the game outright.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But you will have to choose carefully what you invest gold in. Go all-in on one Relic? Spread your gold between many Relics? Level your leader? The right call could win you the game\u2026 or cost you everything.</p>","developers":["Double Edge Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2654490/header.jpg?t=1755819292","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257145303,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257145303/movie480.mp4?t=1748193804","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257145303/movie_max.mp4?t=1748193804"},"name":"Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257145303/0c1a27fa42f96eafda68312e0286215d8657506d/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1748193804","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257145303/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1748193804","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257145303/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1748193804"}}],"name":"Relic Arena","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10+ (64 bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i5, 2.4 Ghz or better<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Integrated HD Graphics 520 w/128MB or better<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 7 GB available space<br></l