ip heroes with genuine historical relics, each providing unique abilities and upgrades, under the guidance of renowned historical figures.","steam_appid":2654490,"support_info":{"email":"contact@doubleedge.gg","url":"https://relicarena.com"},"supported_languages":"English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support","type":"game","website":"http://relicarena.com"}